- trained on all the valid PDB data EXCEPT for the one used in SKEMPI 1.1. : /home/op98/protein_design/mGLI-pp_Oleksii/model/deltaH_combo_model_for_skempi.joblib
- trained on all the valid PDB data EXCEPT for the one used in PRODIGY model: /home/op98/protein_design/mGLI-pp_Oleksii/model/deltaH_combo_model_for_prodigy.joblib
